{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fmxwr2l0","slide":2,"text":"Start with the physical prediction","textPreview":"Start with the physical prediction","textChars":34,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,60,1580,92]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/elofyx4v","slide":2,"text":"Upward is positive; gravity is constant; air resistance is neglected","textPreview":"Upward is positive; gravity is constant; air resistance is neglected","textChars":68,"textLines":1,"bbox":[115,152,1580,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/pszyxc3i","slide":2,"bbox":[130,280,570,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/orqx4rmx","slide":2,"text":"1. At 0 s: y = 0 m","textPreview":"1. At 0 s: y = 0 m","textChars":18,"textLines":1,"bbox":[154,299,522,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/nqhgvmlc","slide":2,"bbox":[130,384,570,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2p8f2h4r","slide":2,"text":"2. The ball rises and slows","textPreview":"2. The ball rises and slows","textChars":27,"textLines":1,"bbox":[154,403,522,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/xgjy1w3e","slide":2,"bbox":[130,488,570,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/cvqx8rmt","slide":2,"text":"3. The graph has one peak","textPreview":"3. The graph has one peak","textChars":25,"textLines":1,"bbox":[154,507,522,38]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/qxgnad4z","slide":2,"bbox":[130,592,570,76]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ry9o3i5k","slide":2,"text":"4. It returns toward y = 0 m","textPreview":"4. It returns toward y = 0 m","textChars":28,"textLines":1,"bbox":[154,611,522,38]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/szi5cnm5","slide":2,"text":"A graph is evidence only if it agrees with this physical story.","textPreview":"A graph is evidence only if it agrees with this physical story.","textChars":63,"textLines":1,"bbox":[900,440,700,90]}
